@startuml
[*] --> Registered : User registration
Registered --> Logged In : Login with teacher/student credentials
Logged In --> Teacher Mode/Student Mode : User selects mode after logging in
Teacher Mode --> Creating Quiz : Teacher creates a new quiz
Creating Quiz --> Drafting Quiz : Teacher saves quiz as draft
Drafting Quiz --> Published Quiz : Teacher posts quiz for students
Published Quiz --> Viewing Results : Teacher views quiz results
Teacher Mode --> Editing Quiz : Teacher edits an existing quiz
Editing Quiz --> Drafting Quiz : Teacher saves edited quiz as draft
Drafting Quiz --> Published Quiz : Teacher posts edited quiz for students
Student Mode --> Selecting Quiz : Student selects a quiz to answer
Selecting Quiz --> Answering Quiz : Student answers the selected quiz
Answering Quiz --> Submitting Quiz : Student submits their quiz
Submitting Quiz --> Viewing Results : Student views result after submitting quiz

Viewing Results --> [*] : User logs out or closes application
@enduml
